    "detailed_description": "<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149980/extras/2087949fb1d9aedd424d030ae6423c38.avif?t=1753364363\" width=688 height=3072 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc98<strong>Love n Life: Happy Student</strong>\ud83d\udc98</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149980/extras/56fb87a37533922b7f0ab7aace8b2cfc.poster.avif?t=1753364363\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149980/extras/56fb87a37533922b7f0ab7aace8b2cfc.webm?t=1753364363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149980/extras/56fb87a37533922b7f0ab7aace8b2cfc.mp4?t=1753364363\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At Reborn Entertainment, creativity drives everything we do as we\u2019re committed to delivering fresh experiences. For us, fun isn\u2019t just a goal, it\u2019s the rule.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2b50<strong> Main Features</strong>  </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience dating through the unique Inventory Management system with over <strong><i>300 unique items.</i></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete the 3 main and 3 side girls' objectives to experience over <i><strong>30 romantic moments with over 100 beautiful illustrations.</strong></i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful girls come to life with Live2D animations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Massive story content and secrets to explore, with about <strong><i>200 events</i></strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mini-games: Cooking, fishing, Sports, reading, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay connected with social apps, texting, collections, and more using your phone.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2b50\u00a0<strong>Innovative Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>For the first time ever</i></strong>, inventory management meets dating-sim in a bold fusion that delivers a truly unique experience. Your items aren\u2019t just for show. They shape how you engage in every conversation and win hearts,\u00a0<strong><i>offering you a sensational experience like no other.\u00a0</i></strong>Each person you encounter brings unique skills and persuasive strategies. Be prepared to adapt and respond to every challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149980/extras/a41bfe2b019cd3fd43c95c23c725db83.poster.avif?t=1753364363\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149980/extras/a41bfe2b019cd3fd43c95c23c725db83.webm?t=1753364363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149980/extras/a41bfe2b019cd3fd43c95c23c725db83.mp4?t=1753364363\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master one of the traits, Confidence, Charm, Kindness, or Knowledge, <i><strong>for great replayability.</strong></i> Each unlocks over 300 powerful items with rich stats. Experiment, combine, and create thrilling builds for endless strategic fun. This addictive core gameplay <i><strong>promises countless hours of entertainment.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149980/extras/15f6be9f2c2445e075c060edc5f6d26c.poster.avif?t=1753364363\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149980/extras/15f6be9f2c2445e075c060edc5f6d26c.webm?t=1753364363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149980/extras/15f6be9f2c2445e075c060edc5f6d26c.mp4?t=1753364363\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149980/extras/9a30ad5cbaeee512aeaaf3966fd1eb1f.avif?t=1753364363\" width=616 height=348 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2b50\u00a0<strong>Story</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're a third-year college student living in the suburbs. After taking a competitive exam, you\u2019re lucky enough to transfer to the prestigious Lingyun University,  located on a small island not far from the mainland coast. The university boasts cutting-edge technology and frequently secures major project contracts with powerful corporations. The school itself also holds <strong><i>many secrets and hidden dramas</i></strong> waiting to be uncovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149980/extras/4490595bcca05c4a2d016c857654c0a4.avif?t=1753364363\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2b50\u00a0<strong>Romance</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're here to gain valuable knowledge\u2026 right? But don\u2019t be surprised when the ladies can\u2019t resist your charm. With <strong><i>over 30 romantic encounters</i></strong>, each more tempting than the last, you\u2019ll find yourself drawn into sensational moments far more thrilling than textbooks. And if you\u2019re daring enough to dig deeper, you might just uncover some hidden pleasures they don\u2019t teach in class.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149980/extras/e8f5b2cd3b2c21b792649b78b6b7befa.avif?t=1753364363\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149980/extras/a990842ae562cebdd839fc4b5c949ff5.avif?t=1753364363\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149980/extras/b3b30acdf64e65fea439fb7f02c14d6a.avif?t=1753364363\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2b50\u00a0<strong>Social Activities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, it\u2019s not always about dating and talking. You need rest, and we understand that. There are plenty of fun activities for you to enjoy, such as playing games, sports, fishing, art sessions, and more, helping you build stronger stats and, most importantly, stronger connections with the girls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149980/extras/203a5f66b77c9ad3c9c4fef47b2c2344.avif?t=1753364363\" width=616 height=616 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149980/extras/d2eb7448724f7e69aeb1cfd5621e4670.avif?t=1753364363\" width=616 height=616 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2b50<strong>The ladies:</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc98\u00a0<strong>Liu Yating</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149980/extras/0c70bb38223df7efebf8f35852d5c0ca.poster.avif?t=1753364363\" width=600 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149980/extras/0c70bb38223df7efebf8f35852d5c0ca.webm?t=1753364363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149980/extras/0c70bb38223df7efebf8f35852d5c0ca.mp4?t=1753364363\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're in the same class as a beautiful, carefree girl who loves to explore new things. She\u2019s destined to become your best friend.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc98\u00a0<strong>Chen Meiling</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149980/extras/0d56610c858edad7213a273c46234462.poster.avif?t=1753364363\" width=600 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149980/extras/0d56610c858edad7213a273c46234462.webm?t=1753364363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149980/extras/0d56610c858edad7213a273c46234462.mp4?t=1753364363\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The literature teacher at your school and the dorm manager where you live. With her sweet, kind, and playful personality, she\u2019s the teacher every student loves having in class!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc98\u00a0<strong>Qin Yilin</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149980/extras/77098f3e1ab2923c97ad5f70aeee0ad9.poster.avif?t=1753364363\" width=600 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149980/extras/77098f3e1ab2923c97ad5f70aeee0ad9.webm?t=1753364363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149980/extras/77098f3e1ab2923c97ad5f70aeee0ad9.mp4?t=1753364363\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Only knowledge and discipline create elite students. Without them, you're dust.&quot; The Student Council President is cool, elegant, and well-organized. She\u2019s determined to push every student to reach their highest potential\u2014no matter what it takes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc98\u00a0<strong>And Other Mysterious Ladies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The island\u2019s full of surprises and the girls are the biggest ones. They\u2019ll charm you, confuse you, maybe even scare you a little... all while dragging you into their delightful mess of mystery and mayhem. Your life\u2019s not just getting turned upside down, but it will get a lot crazier than that...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149980/extras/a4269847ce5ade853cbeea87951bc311.avif?t=1753364363\" width=616 height=616 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149980/extras/6271803a27097d20d9a274f210b3f826.poster.avif?t=1753364363\" width=600 height=52 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149980/extras/6271803a27097d20d9a274f210b3f826.webm?t=1753364363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149980/extras/6271803a27097d20d9a274f210b3f826.mp4?t=1753364363\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
