e_item_assets/steam/apps/3149980/extras/e8f5b2cd3b2c21b792649b78b6b7befa.avif?t=1753364363\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149980/extras/a990842ae562cebdd839fc4b5c949ff5.avif?t=1753364363\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149980/extras/b3b30acdf64e65fea439fb7f02c14d6a.avif?t=1753364363\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2b50\u00a0<strong>Social Activities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, it\u2019s not always about dating and talking. You need rest, and we understand that. There are plenty of fun activities for you to enjoy, such as playing games, sports, fishing, art sessions, and more, helping you build stronger stats and, most importantly, stronger connections with the girls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149980/extras/203a5f66b77c9ad3c9c4fef47b2c2344.avif?t=1753364363\" width=616 height=616 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149980/extras/d2eb7448724f7e69aeb1cfd5621e4670.avif?t=1753364363\" width=616 height=616 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2b50<strong>The ladies:</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc98\u00a0<strong>Liu Yating</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149980/extras/0c70bb38223df7efebf8f35852d5c0ca.poster.avif?t=1753364363\" width=600 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149980/extras/0c70bb38223df7efebf8f35852d5c0ca.webm?t=1753364363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149980/extras/0c70bb38223df7efebf8f35852d5c0ca.mp4?t=1753364363\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're in the same class as a beautiful, carefree girl who loves to explore new things. She\u2019s destined to become your best friend.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc98\u00a0<strong>Chen Meiling</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149980/extras/0d56610c858edad7213a273c46234462.poster.avif?t=1753364363\" width=600 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149980/extras/0d56610c858edad7213a273c46234462.webm?t=1753364363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149980/extras/0d56610c858edad7213a273c46234462.mp4?t=1753364363\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The literature teacher at your school and the dorm manager where you live. With her sweet, kind, and playful personality, she\u2019s the teacher every student loves having in class!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc98\u00a0<strong>Qin Yilin</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149980/extras/77098f3e1ab2923c97ad5f70aeee0ad9.poster.avif?t=1753364363\" width=600 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149980/extras/77098f3e1ab2923c97ad5f70aeee0ad9.webm?t=1753364363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149980/extras/77098f3e1ab2923c97ad5f70aeee0ad9.mp4?t=1753364363\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Only knowledge and discipline create elite students. Without them, you're dust.&quot; The Student Council President is cool, elegant, and well-organized. She\u2019s determined to push every student to reach their highest potential\u2014no matter what it takes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc98\u00a0<strong>And Other Mysterious Ladies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The island\u2019s full of surprises and the girls are the biggest ones. They\u2019ll charm you, confuse you, maybe even scare you a little... all while dragging you into their delightful mess of mystery and mayhem. Your life\u2019s not just getting turned upside down, but it will get a lot crazier than that...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149980/extras/a4269847ce5ade853cbeea87951bc311.avif?t=1753364363\" width=616 height=616 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149980/extras/6271803a27097d20d9a274f210b3f826.poster.avif?t=1753364363\" width=600 height=52 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149980/extras/6271803a27097d20d9a274f210b3f826.webm?t=1753364363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149980/extras/6271803a27097d20d9a274f210b3f826.mp4?t=1753364363\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Love n Life: Happy Student, a unique dating sim, incorporates inventory management for the first time. As a top-scoring third-year student, you are chosen to join the most prestigious college, where you\u2019ll meet gorgeous ladies. Discover intriguing personalities and the school\u2019s mysteries.",
